<title>CANADA: Agrium delaying nitrogen project plans.</title>
<headline>Agrium delaying nitrogen project plans.</headline>
<dateline>CALGARY 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Agrium Inc said on Thursday it evaluated the timing of its proposed Midwest nitrogen project and decided not to proceed with it at this time.</p>
<p>&quot;We remain optimistic that market demand for nitrogen fertilizers will eventually create a requirement for additional production capacity in the U.S. midwest. But we have concluded that the timing of the project is premature,&quot; Agrium president John Van Brunt said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100</p>
